{"strings":["LPCO","Details related to Licenses, Permits, Certificates or Others.","Document identifier","Identification of a specific document.","Document reference number, assigned by the Government","Authentication","Details related to the authentication of a document.","Actual authentication date/time","Date and time when this authentication was actually signed or otherwise authenticated.","Authentication statement","Statement providing proof that the document has been authenicated.","Authenticator","Details related to an authenticating party.","Authenticator name","Name of the party which certifies that a document is authentic.","Authenticator identifier","Identification of a party which certifies that a document is authentic.","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Role code","Code specifying the role of a party.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","In case of using Additional statement code, text or indicator you can make the information more specific by also using Additional statement type.\nIf there are more than 1 occurrences you should always use it in combination with the type.","Additional statement code","Code specifying the form of an additional statement.","User code list","Additional statement description","Description of an additional statement.","Additional statement type code","Code specifying the subject of the additional statement.","StatementTypeCodeList","Consignment","Details related to the transport between a consignor and a consignee as specified in the transport contract document.","Total number of packages","Quantity specifying the total number of packages of the entire document (e.g. declaration/consignment).","Boarded quantity","Quantity specifying the total number shown on bill of lading or on split shipment. It will be the actual number of pieces boarded on the conveyance. (Not necessarily the smallest external packaging unit for the shipment).","BorderTransportMeans","Details related to the means of transport crossing the border of the Customs territory.","Crossing the border transport means name","Name to identify the means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","Transport means crossing the border identifier","Identification of the means of transport used in crossing the border.","Sea: ITU Standard or Lloyd's number\nAir: IATA aircraft ID\nRoad: national license plate\nRail: locomotive number","Type of means of transport crossing the border code","Code specifying type of means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","TransportMeansTypeCodeList","ArrivalLocation","Details related to the first arrival location.","Port of arrival identifier","Identification of the arrival location. This would be a port for sea, airport for air and border post for land crossing.","UN/LOCODE + User codes OR User code list","Consignee","Details related to the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee name","Name of the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee identifier","Identification of a party to which goods are consigned.","ConsignmentItem","Details related to an item in a consignment.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Commodity","Details related to the properties of the goods.","Goods description","Description of the nature of a goods item sufficient to identify it for cross-border regulatory purposes such as customs, phytosanitary, statistical or transport.","Commodity lot identifier","Identification of the production lot by number.","Intended use statement","Statement regarding the intended use of the commodity.","Intended use code","Code specifying the intended use of the commodity.","IntendedUseCodeList","ApprovedEstablishmentLocation","Details related to a facility approved for a specific purpose by a government authority.","Approved establishment location name","Name of the location of a facility approved for a specific purpose by a government authority.","Approved establishment location name identifier","Identification of a facility approved for a specific purpose by a government authority.","UN/LOCODE + User codes OR User codes","Classification","Details related to the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification identifier","Identification of the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification name code","Code specifying the scientific name of original plant/animal used as a material for food products, medications, cosmetics, medical materials, etc.","ClassificationNameCodeList","Commodity classification type code","Code specifying the commodity classification  (e.g. Harmonized Tariff Schedule (HTS), Export Control Classification Code (ECCC), UNDG Code list, International Code of Zoological Nomenc).","UN/EDIFACT code list 7143","Manufacturer","Details related to the party which manufactures goods.","Manufacturer name","Name of the party that manufactures goods.","Manufacturer identifier","Identification of a party which manufactures goods.","Producer","Details related to the producer of the product.","Producer name","Name of the party or person who has produced the product.","Producer identifier","Identification of the party or person who has produced the product.","ProductName","Details related to the name of a product.","Commodity name","Name or term that identifies the goods assigned by a seller as distinct from those of other sellers, in legal terms known as trademark, which helps to identify one item, a family of items, or all items of that seller.","Commodity name qualifier code","Code specifying the commodity name (e.g. common name, registered name, brand name).","UN/EDIFACT code list 7081","DestinationLocation","Details related to the destination location.","Destination country code","Code specifying the country of destination.","CountryCodeList","Destination country name","Name of the country of destination.","GoodsMeasure","Details related to goods weight, quantities, and amounts.","Net net weight","Weight of the goods themselves without any packing.","Origin","Details related to the origin of the goods.","Country of origin code","Code specifying the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Country of origin name","Name of the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Transitional element","Region of origin identifier","Identification of the region in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the purposes of application of the Customs tariff, or quantitative restrictions, or of any other measure related to trade.","Packaging","Details related to packaging.","Number of packages","Quantity specifying the number of individual items packaged in such a way that they cannot be divided without first undoing the packing.","Type of packages identification code","Code specifying the type of package of an item.","PackageTypeCodeList","Consignor","Details related to the party which, by contract with a carrier, consigns or sends goods with the carrier, or has them conveyed by him.","Consignor name","Name of the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering transport.","Consignor identifier","Identification of  the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering the transport.","Control","Details related to (governmental) examination.","Certifier","Details related to the party which certifies something.","Certifier name","Name of the party who has provided the certification.","Certifying party identifier","Identification of a party which certifies something.","LoadingLocation","Details related to the location at which the goods (i.e., consignments) are loaded on to the active means of transport.","Loading location name","Name of a seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station or other location at which goods are loaded onto the means of transport being used for their carriage.","Loading location identifier","Identification of a seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station or other location at which goods are loaded onto the means of transport being used for their carriage.","Temperature","Details related to temperature.","Flashpoint temperature","Measure of the flashpoint temperature of dangerous goods.","Commodity temperature category code","Code specifying the storage condition of a commodity.","TemperatureCategoryCodeList","Actual temperature","Measure of temperature.","Storage requirement temperature","Temperature required to be maintained for a commodity, or in a container, or in a conveyance.","Minimum storage requirement temperature","Minimum temperature required to be maintained for a commodity, or in a container, or in a conveyance.","Maximum storage requirement temperature","Maximum temperature required to be maintained for a commodity, or in a container, or in a conveyance.","TransportEquipment","Details related to transport equipment used for the consignment.","Equipment size and type code","Code specifying the characteristics (e.g. size and type of a piece of transport equipment).","ISO, IATA, EDIFACT (8053 or 8155) OR User code list","Equipment identifier","Identification of the equipment (e.g. unit load device by marks, letters, and/or numbers).","ISO 6346, IATA","Seal","Details related to the seal affixed to a piece of transport equipment, used to secure an object and protect from unauthorized entry or tampering.","Seal identifier","Identification of a seal affixed to a piece of transport equipment by number.","Exporter","Details related to the person/party who makes or on whose behalf an export declaration is made.","Exporter name","Name of the person who makes, or on whose behalf the export declaration is made, and who is the owner of the goods or has similar right of disposal over them at the time when the declaration is accepted.","Exporter identifier","Identification of the party who makes, or on whose behalf the export declaration is made, and who is the owner of the goods or has similar rights of disposal over them at the time when the declaration is accepted.","Importer","Details related to the party who makes - or on whose behalf a customs clearing agent or other authorized person makes - an import declaration.","Importer name","Name of the party who makes, or on whose behalf a customs clearing agent or other authorized person makes, an import declaration. This may include a person who is in possession of the goods or to whom the goods are consigned.","Importer identifier","Identification of a party who makes, or on whose behalf a customs clearing agent or other authorized person makes, an import declaration. This may include a person who has possession of the goods or to whom the goods are consigned.","ResponsibleGovernmentAgency","Details related to the responsible government agency.","Responsible government agency identifier","Identification of the government agency, responsible for regulatory and statutory obligations.","UN/LOCODE + User codes"],"root":{"s":"LPCO","n":0,"d":1,"t":"C","c":"","w":"74B","u":"0001L","q":"1","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/LPCO","src":"BIP LPCO:4","k":[{"s":"identification","n":2,"d":3,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"ID","f":"an..70","r":4,"w":"D014","u":"0001L","q":"7","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/identificationIdentifier","ub":["cites","codex","e-phyto","eata","ecoc","etir-carv","oie-cert"],"src":"BIP LPCO:10"},{"s":"Authentication","n":5,"d":6,"t":"C","c":"0..*","w":"61B","u":"0045